  "evidence": {
    "iris": "BuildIrisTable computes sqrt(circleOffset*(2*radius-circleOffset)), clips centerX plus/minus halfWidth to0..255, and mirrors96 scanlines. The first byte is the right edge and the second is the left edge; the remaining two bytes remain untouched. Radius uses the selected iris, while centerX deliberately remains mIris[0].x.",
