    "directions": "At main ROM table0x02082214, signed halfword pairs for angles0,0x4000,0x8000,0xc000 are respectively(0,4096),(4096,0),(0,-4096),(-4096,0). Combined with the drift calculations, this establishes up/down per column and left/right per row. The random-direction expression selects sixteen0x1000 steps.",
    "ownership": "Queue27 state b9fb0513bfcfc9b9f7f50eed980d41bddf0baeb3 has no active Luigi class/file/range conflict. Production ov006 ranges: text0x020efc0c..0x020f3834, init0x02130f64..0x021311c8, ctor0x021335ac..0x021335b0, data0x0213cd8c..0x0213ce54, bss0x021421ec..0x021422a4.",
    "runtime_validation": "No new emulator claim: names follow explicit arithmetic, dispatch tables, transfer assembly and ROM trigonometric values.",
    "retained_constraints": [
      "Keep the IRQ handler integer-address cast at data_023c0000+0x3ff8 and the opaque0x300-byte iris-table indexing view.",
      "Keep UpdatePenalties raw pointer formation from this, TickPictureFlash distinct timer address forms and exits, RestartPicture shared byte base, and PlaceNextPicture raw grid-cell address.",
      "Keep volatile tile-copy values in ChooseTarget and InitResources, scalar Fix12 ABI declarations, manual factory/lifecycle handling, PMF order and pragmas.",
